  <item>
    <title>[养狗也是] 谈恋爱谈到最后和理想型相差甚远 - Vivi x 柚桑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6866a24760f8f77d40b79886</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6866a24760f8f77d40b79886</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 03 Jul 2025 15:43:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvdQcKI56y8hAtYozdzRAa1_kPES.jpg"></figure><ul><li><p><span>关于哈萨克猎犬</span></p></li></ul><p><span>哈萨克猎犬是原始的古老犬种，哈萨克猎犬产于</span><a href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%93%88%E8%90%A8%E5%85%8B%E6%96%AF%E5%9D%A6/130158?fromModule=lemma_inlink" data-url="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%93%88%E8%90%A8%E5%85%8B%E6%96%AF%E5%9D%A6/130158?fromModule=lemma_inlink"><span>哈萨克斯坦</span></a><span>，是典型的视觉追踪猎物的捕猎犬种，已有二千七百多年的历史。分长毛型和短毛型两种，以长毛型为多。哈萨克猎犬又叫塔兹猎犬，“塔兹”的意思是没有毛，短毛，光滑的的意思。</span></p><p><span>哈萨克猎犬在中亚地区都有，血统纯正的在哈萨克斯坦。</span></p><p><span>有句老话说得好：“一条哈萨克猎犬养活全家人”。这种猎犬曾经是游牧人家的重要财产，从上世纪下半叶以来，它们的数量开始减少。时至今日，真正的哈萨克猎犬数量很少。</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqmivlK9F7c0ugpWlMqCabWeksA5.jpg"></figure><p><span>[本期你能听到]</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">00:02:15</a> Kalagai 七个月，就能吃两盒盒饭！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="257">00:04:17</a> 卡拉是条狗：我们摄影团队的秘密武器~</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">00:06:17</a> 一条哈萨克猎犬真的可以养活一家人？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">00:10:22</a> Kalagai可能没法狩猎，但他在成长中展现出的依赖让我动容。</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="744">00:12:24</a> 我是掌管狗饭的神</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnx_NvVIkmPw52fI5ZviBDBwT1KH.jpg"></figure><p><strong><span>[更多关于Kalagai]</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>📕小红书：</span></strong><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65f93888000000000b033283?xsec_token=YBtdbem-2zbTGjjYZu-Edhp7RQ3j3mqSmzu50-_9dbTwU%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=67b4b232000000000e01c081&amp;apptime=1751556152&amp;share_id=0533a8c424da4b8e83326c18f864d2ad&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65f93888000000000b033283?xsec_token=YBtdbem-2zbTGjjYZu-Edhp7RQ3j3mqSmzu50-_9dbTwU%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=67b4b232000000000e01c081&amp;apptime=1751556152&amp;share_id=0533a8c424da4b8e83326c18f864d2ad&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>Kalagai1102</span></a><strong><span> 卡拉是条狗</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqQtpUbGtdOBjeqOHc_zgLhpW0-v.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtucxBxM91RDTN4BDK76LJPaGoFp.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs9zzW_fD6CbxYHREkKZMIxe2t6m.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv0kZ1CpJEDHauJknXSxxu7qBgmd.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmnlfkHFVGQKCkAyZWxjsAxXZlvU.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqir8v3C-ivNYWDEPNhyz_-0lYTk.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjEf54rBUQFwAbIqY1QWlSxJrKOU.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FulhKQCONL0BZXstgYsqKja3BnHx.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjdD_ZiX81z0PbHFz-c7vFnKl4vN.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq4ej8INoBCjOZyabOOjeGqS9HPV.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlAPnLMqW0EdCa7reV9LAV9zowLc.jpg"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrmS_IUlm2pcfnNMsytp4uHXoNM4.jpg"></figure><p><span>[更多关于Kalagai]</span></p><p><span>📕小红书：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65f93888000000000b033283?xsec_token=YBtdbem-2zbTGjjYZu-Edhp7RQ3j3mqSmzu50-_9dbTwU%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=67b4b232000000000e01c081&amp;apptime=1751556152&amp;share_id=0533a8c424da4b8e83326c18f864d2ad&amp;share_channel=copy_link" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/65f93888000000000b033283?xsec_token=YBtdbem-2zbTGjjYZu-Edhp7RQ3j3mqSmzu50-_9dbTwU%3D&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=67b4b232000000000e01c081&amp;apptime=1751556152&amp;share_id=0533a8c424da4b8e83326c18f864d2ad&amp;share_channel=copy_link"><span>Kalagai1102</span></a><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
