  <item>
    <title>[企鹅公路] 🐧玩具000 - 小小科学家的观察笔记📕</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67bda8ca05a90dfd0dc7f9ee</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67bda8ca05a90dfd0dc7f9ee</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Feb 2025 11:27:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>影片-企鹅公路</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>动画电影《企鹅公路》改编自日本作家森见登美彦著作的同名小说，作品由Studio colorido制作，于2019年在中国上映。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpQytqHwjRZ1nOsTsIiQ5LtfB5c7.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>📕</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>玩具 - 观察笔记</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>小小研究员青山，</span></p><span></span><p><span>开启任一课题所用上的小本子。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📎</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>架构 - 思维记录体系</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>知识库 → 结构化存储技能知识</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>日志流→ 记录日常实践过程</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>复盘墙 → 阶段性成果与教训沉淀</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>灵感池 → 捕捉碎片化创新想法</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrsQUsxiwTmLtjBVXMYdOu2e_rNZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>✍</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>历史 - 经典观察日记与研究笔记</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>[1] 欧阳修</span></p><span></span><p><span>《归田录》1067 ↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnJFZwIbYh-jtUzmPKEFeoy3zCSe.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>[2] 沈括</span></p><span></span><p><span>《梦溪笔谈》1086-1093 ↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpHmM7tNI33sCAyDcOINGuL_-BTO.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>[3]（意）达·芬奇 1503-1504</span></p><span></span><p><span>马德里手稿 ↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhXtoPlJ-9qs0TORiOtkxJU2Bnz4.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>[4] （荷）安东尼·范·列文虎克</span></p><span></span><p><span>显微镜观察日记 1632-1723 ↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjpRYBpkgxBvHsgKXmqhoDWZSpXX.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>[5] 李锐</span></p><span></span><p><span>《观妙居日记》 1769-1817↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqDpodxKHZvid97n3dMTyz2OXLu4.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>[6]（俄） 德米特里·伊万诺维奇·门捷列夫</span></p><span></span><p><span>元素周期表笔记 1834-1907 ↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjPD0tw2uJwhe9-o7wYPtcSOEUsW.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>[7] 卡尔·马克思</span></p><span></span><p><span>《布鲁塞尔笔记》1845↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvjla12jfgW6tQsI_UoZinXKDe4w.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>[8] （英）查尔斯·罗伯特 · 达尔文</span></p><span></span><p><span>《B本笔记本》1859↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjEVSGBebn6qAqr9989FlRvJz6c6.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjBPNK6lf99vxyl6kwWGihPpbrcm.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>[9]（美）亚历山大·格拉汉姆·贝尔</span></p><span></span><p><span>笔记手稿 1876 ↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtOMlonLc2o28iWqvL2yNTzQhSPQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>[10] （法）玛丽·居里（居里夫人）</span></p><span></span><p><span>《放射性笔记本》1898↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtEvQUUVylf_ZzWzFWDhxkFaus70.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>[11] （美、瑞）阿尔伯特·爱因斯坦，</span></p><span></span><p><span>广义相对论起源两份仅存手稿之一1912-1913 ↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhP-qXr33257HAWfog-xWiui9ZRW.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>[12] （英）艾萨克·牛顿</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Waste Book》1965-1966↓</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlJzk_CW6nE15DbHHBdPAEbhV1WI.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuUpF_NMBpxvoe77ZUrWC8O0VaCn.png"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>*图片均来源于网络，仅供交流学习，侵删</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>OP: </span><a href="https://www.ear0.com/sound/show/soundid-42698" data-url="https://www.ear0.com/sound/show/soundid-42698"><span>Cinematic Piano Serenity</span></a><span> &nbsp;by Ilariio 🌊</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 </span><a href="https://www.ear0.com/pack/249516" data-url="https://www.ear0.com/pack/249516"><span>声音合辑</span></a></p>]]></description>
